rt to support us.\" [S29T1][S29T2]. Calvin's reminiscing made him nostalgic — he and the friend used to freestyle and talk about getting famous as teenagers — \"it's crazy how life has changed. But being around certain people still sparks those same feelings.\" — and he shared a photo of the two of them freestyling as teenagers (a photography of two men standing on a sidewalk with a car in the background); Dave: \"Wow, that's a great pic!\" and asked whether that person made a big difference during the trip [S29T3][S29T4]; Calvin: \"He's been such a great friend to me. Always there to support and encourage me. His positivity has made a big difference in my journey.\" [S29T5]; Dave: \"It's great how someone's support and encouragement can really shape our lives! They give us the motivation to keep going and trust ourselves.\" — and asked whether Calvin finds having supportive people around him important for his artist development; Calvin: yes — \"Having supportive people is key for me to grow as an artist. They motivate me to get better and stay true to myself. Having support is vital, especially in this tough music industry.\" (Calvin's side in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md) — and he shared a photo of a group of people sitting around a desk [S29T6][S29T7]. Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! Is this a pic of some musicians you're collaborating with?\" — unanswered in this excerpt [S29T8]. (Calvin's side in the Boston trip, Music, and Relationships sections of /memories/calvin.md)","text_sha256":"30d6e49ccf8eeff44c20a48234c3a83ca1079cf68548138d8339e06857b8f5b7","timestamp":"2023-11-13T21:15:00"}],"integrity":{"post_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","pre_tree_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","store_unchanged":true,"verified":true},"metrics":{"completion_tokens":1487,"filesystem_tool_calls":5,"model_calls":5,"orchestration_calls":4,"prompt_tokens":135068,"provider_request_attempts":5,"p